---
/*
  Type-led by design. Every neighbouring section carries a large photograph, so
  another image here would make the page read as an unbroken slideshow. This
  section is the pause between the product tiles and the market details.
*/
---

<section class="story section section--light" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="story__inner">
      <p class="story__eyebrow">Why Got Chaii?</p>
      <h2 class="story__title">
      Rooted in India.<br /><em>Made for here.</em>
    </h2>
      <p class="story__lede">
      Chaii is more than a drink. It is a welcome, a pause, and a reason to stay
      a little longer. We blend whole spices in small batches and pour them at a
      market stall in Sacramento — the flavor and warmth of Indian chaii, in
      modern everyday life.
    </p>

      <ul class="story__values" role="list">
      <li class="value">
        <span class="value__mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <h3 class="value__h">Real ingredients</h3>
        <p>Whole spices and loose-leaf tea. Nothing artificial, nothing dusty.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="value">
        <span class="value__mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <h3 class="value__h">Indian inspiration</h3>
        <p>Recipes built on how chaii is actually brewed, not how it is exported.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="value">
        <span class="value__mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <h3 class="value__h">Made for connection</h3>
        <p>Small batches, poured by hand, at a stall where we know your name.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story__inner {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .story__eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--raspberry);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .story__title {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-m);
  }

  .story__title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--indigo);
  }

  .story__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-end: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .story__values {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-m);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  }

  .value {
    padding-block-start: var(--space-s);
    border-block-start: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .value__mark {
    color: var(--burnt-orange);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  .value__h {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-block: 0.3rem 0.35rem;
  }

  .value p {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
</style>
